     production emitted a value with no source. That was wrong: I was grepping
     the stale feature branch, not main. The rung exists (VTID-04575).
  2. First fix targeted buildResumeDirective only — the WRONG function for the
     reported symptom. resume_thread uses buildResumeThreadOpenTrigger.
  3. First fix added "Respond ONLY in ${langName}". Withdrawn: rung 4's own
     recorded comment shows that shape was measured at 2/11 and reverted
     (VTID-04010 follow-up #1/#2 / VTID-04015). Both fixes are now generic.
  4. First cut rendered "Respond ONLY in German. Do NOT switch to German." for a
     de session. Caught by reading the golden diff, not by accepting it.
  5. After restarting the branch from main (its prior PR was merged), the edited
     file was replayed from the older base and silently reverted three unrelated
     newer main changes to it. Caught in the snapshot diff; edits re-applied onto
     main's real file and the diff re-checked until clean.

